 (``wire_fp8``, the transport's codec); the expert nodes decode them to the same bf16 values before their experts.
+
+TF_GLM_PARTIALS_BF16=1 (``partials_bf16``, on every node) has the expert nodes send a prompt window's partial sums back
+rounded to bf16; ``collect`` lands both in the shared expert's plane of ``afd_recv``, widens them into the first two
+planes (exact) and then writes the shared expert there, so ``hc_post`` adds the same three fp32 planes in the same order.
 """
 
